WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.875
What happens when 800 of the world’s most elite footballers

00:00:02.875 --> 00:00:05.625
and their managers live together under one roof?

00:00:05.625 --> 00:00:07.583
Players stop being polite

00:00:07.583 --> 00:00:09.791
and start getting Real

00:00:09.791 --> 00:00:10.666
This is

00:00:10.666 --> 00:00:11.583
The Champions

00:00:11.875 --> 00:00:14.583
I'm Paul and I know how to make headlines

00:00:16.333 --> 00:00:19.750
I've scored more times in Manchester than Noel Gallagher

00:00:20.083 --> 00:00:21.083
I'm so good

00:00:21.083 --> 00:00:24.333
I'm in the MLS, and they still put me in this intro

00:00:24.375 --> 00:00:27.833
Everybody knows I’m at the same level as Messi and Ronaldo…

00:00:29.083 --> 00:00:30.500
...why is everybody laughing?

00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:46.625
Bayern Munich Oktoberfest

00:00:46.625 --> 00:00:48.041
Ooh

00:00:48.041 --> 00:00:48.875
Absolutely nicht

00:00:48.875 --> 00:00:50.958
Aw! First, the World Cup. Now this!?

00:00:50.958 --> 00:00:52.541
I don’t get to go to anything fun

00:00:52.541 --> 00:00:54.708
OK, for one, the World Cup sucked this year.

00:00:54.708 --> 00:00:57.375
Secondly, zis party is for dummkopfs

00:00:57.375 --> 00:00:58.333
Marco, please!

00:00:58.333 --> 00:01:00.375
They have a chocolate fountain...just like home!

00:01:00.375 --> 00:01:02.500
As your captain, I say NEIN!

00:01:04.041 --> 00:01:06.208
He has a chocolate fountain... in his home?

00:01:06.208 --> 00:01:07.500
Yes, I’m from Hershey

00:01:07.500 --> 00:01:08.583
It’s weird there

00:01:08.583 --> 00:01:10.791
So every year, Bayern zey throw zis party

00:01:10.791 --> 00:01:12.750
and act like zey are just cool fun guys

00:01:12.750 --> 00:01:14.291
But really, ze whole thing

00:01:14.291 --> 00:01:16.958
is just a ploy to poach ze best young players

00:01:16.958 --> 00:01:18.666
from ze other Bundesliga teams

00:01:18.666 --> 00:01:20.875
Marco’s a vee bit sensitive about zis

00:01:20.875 --> 00:01:23.583
because he’s lost many Dortmund friends over ze years

00:01:23.875 --> 00:01:24.958
Lewandowski

00:01:24.958 --> 00:01:25.791
Hummels

00:01:25.791 --> 00:01:26.875
And of course

00:01:26.875 --> 00:01:27.333
me

00:01:27.666 --> 00:01:28.791
What can I say?

00:01:29.041 --> 00:01:31.750
I was young, and I needed to Pep my cherry

00:01:36.041 --> 00:01:38.125
Hey, have you guys seen my lederhosen?

00:01:38.125 --> 00:01:39.208
I can’t find zem

00:01:40.750 --> 00:01:41.666
Scheisse!

00:01:41.666 --> 00:01:42.625
Ow

00:01:43.208 --> 00:01:45.000
Heja BVB!

00:01:49.375 --> 00:01:52.625
Wow! Zer’s like twice as many people at zis party

00:01:52.666 --> 00:01:53.958
as there is in Hoffenheim

00:01:53.958 --> 00:01:55.875
Ja! I just saw someone I didn’t know!

00:01:55.875 --> 00:01:57.166
Hey, where is coach?

00:01:57.166 --> 00:01:58.875
C’mon, let me through

00:01:58.875 --> 00:02:00.125
My whole team is in there

00:02:00.125 --> 00:02:03.083
Sorry. I have to see ID for anyone who looks 16 or younger.

00:02:05.666 --> 00:02:06.625
Hey zer!

00:02:06.625 --> 00:02:07.500
Oh hi

00:02:07.500 --> 00:02:09.583
You’re ze American kid for Dortmund, right?

00:02:09.583 --> 00:02:10.166
Chris?

00:02:10.166 --> 00:02:11.541
Christian, yeah

00:02:11.541 --> 00:02:12.791
Oh cool, cool

00:02:12.791 --> 00:02:13.583
I’m Jerome

00:02:13.583 --> 00:02:14.833
Zis is Thomas

00:02:14.833 --> 00:02:15.458
Oh, please

00:02:15.458 --> 00:02:17.625
You can just call me Raumdeuter

00:02:17.625 --> 00:02:20.083
Raumdeuter is a nickname I gave to myself

00:02:20.083 --> 00:02:21.708
There’s no word in English for it

00:02:21.708 --> 00:02:24.333
but it sort of means “space interpreter.”

00:02:24.333 --> 00:02:25.833
It’s very cool actually

00:02:25.833 --> 00:02:27.333
Do you see him anywhere?

00:02:27.333 --> 00:02:28.125
Nein

00:02:28.125 --> 00:02:30.333
If I were American, where would I be?

00:02:30.333 --> 00:02:31.125
Aha!

00:02:31.125 --> 00:02:33.333
At the weisswurst breakfast sausage station

00:02:33.333 --> 00:02:35.250
after breakfast time!

00:02:35.250 --> 00:02:36.666
Hurensöhne!

00:02:36.666 --> 00:02:38.500
Zer he is. Let’s go...TZE!

00:02:38.500 --> 00:02:39.875
So yeah...it’s my new bar

00:02:39.875 --> 00:02:40.875
The Flying Dutchman

00:02:40.875 --> 00:02:42.041
We’re having an after-party there

00:02:42.041 --> 00:02:42.666
You should come

00:02:42.666 --> 00:02:43.958
We don’t go to DIVE bars!

00:02:45.833 --> 00:02:50.333
So what’s, like, your favorite thing about the Bundesliga?

00:02:50.375 --> 00:02:51.958
If I’m being honest

00:02:51.958 --> 00:02:54.666
I don’t really consider us in ze Bundesliga

00:02:55.416 --> 00:02:57.708
Yeah...we’re sort of like PSG in Ligue 1

00:02:57.708 --> 00:03:00.000
or Justin Timberlake in NSYNC…

00:03:00.000 --> 00:03:02.500
Let’s just say if ze Bundesliga is Baywatch

00:03:02.500 --> 00:03:04.041
we’re David Hasselhoff

00:03:04.791 --> 00:03:06.583
He doesn’t know David Hasselhoff. You know why?

00:03:06.583 --> 00:03:09.583
Because he’s ONLY 20 YEARS OLD, YOU BAVARIAN CREEPS!

00:03:09.583 --> 00:03:10.500
Raumdeuter

00:03:10.500 --> 00:03:11.250
Are you OK?

00:03:11.250 --> 00:03:13.458
No! I just need some space.

00:03:13.458 --> 00:03:15.416
Just please give me some space to interpret!

00:03:15.833 --> 00:03:17.041
You can’t be talking to zem

00:03:17.041 --> 00:03:18.000
Zey are all jerks!

00:03:18.000 --> 00:03:19.500
You’re not my dad

00:03:19.500 --> 00:03:22.250
You’re just bitter because they never wanted you

00:03:24.250 --> 00:03:25.208
How dare you

00:03:25.208 --> 00:03:26.583
Fine. You want him?

00:03:26.583 --> 00:03:28.916
€70 million, and he’s yours

00:03:28.916 --> 00:03:30.458
Wait, what?

00:03:30.458 --> 00:03:31.541
For him?

00:03:31.541 --> 00:03:32.916
70...million?

00:03:32.916 --> 00:03:34.958
For him? No thanks.

